    },
    "Your .zshrc also loads one (for example Homebrew's `brew command-not-found-init`). The MacToys block comes last, so it wins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die .zshrc lädt ebenfalls einen (z. B. `brew command-not-found-init` von Homebrew). Der MacToys-Block kommt zuletzt und hat daher Vorrang."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu .zshrc también carga uno (por ejemplo, `brew command-not-found-init` de Homebrew). El bloque de MacToys va al final, así que prevalece."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre .zshrc en charge aussi un (par exemple `brew command-not-found-init` de Homebrew). Le bloc MacToys vient en dernier, il l’emporte donc."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anche il tuo .zshrc ne carica uno (ad esempio `brew command-not-found-init` di Homebrew). Il blocco MacToys viene per ultimo, quindi prevale."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ".zshrcでもハンドラが読み込まれています（例: Homebrewの`brew command-not-found-init`）。MacToysのブロックは最後にあるため、こちらが優先されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ".zshrc에서도 핸들러를 로드합니다(예: Homebrew의 `brew command-not-found-init`). MacToys 블록이 마지막에 있으므로 MacToys 핸들러가 적용됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu .zshrc também carrega um (por exemplo, o `brew command-not-found-init` do Homebrew). O bloco do MacToys vem por último, então ele prevalece."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ваш .zshrc тоже загружает такой обработчик (например, `brew command-not-found-init` от Homebrew). Блок MacToys идет последним, поэтому срабатывает он."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 .zshrc 也载入了一个处理程序（例如 Homebrew 的 `brew command-not-found-init`）。MacToys 区块位于最后，因此以它为准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 .zshrc 也會載入一個（例如 Homebrew 的 `brew command-not-found-init`）。MacToys 區塊位於最後，因此會優先採用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
